---

<BaseLayout
  title="A Day at WCP — West Chester Preschool"
  description="What a day at West Chester Preschool actually looks like: full daily schedules for Twos, Threes, and Pre-K AM/PM, plus photos from our classrooms."
>
  <Hero
    eyebrow={hero?.eyebrow ?? 'A Peek Inside a WCP Morning'}
    title={hero?.heroTitle ?? 'What a day at WCP actually looks like.'}
    lead={hero?.lead ??
      'Every session at WCP is a mix of free play, guided activities, snack, and outdoor time. Here is a full look at how each class spends their morning, or afternoon.'}
    image={prekCircleTime}
    imageAlt="A teacher reads to a class of children sitting together on the classroom rug during circle time"
  >
    <Fragment slot="actions">
      <Button href="/enroll" variant="accent" size="lg">Enroll Your Child</Button>
      <Button href="/enroll" variant="outline-white" size="lg">Schedule a Tour</Button>
    </Fragment>
  </Hero>

  <Section bg="white" labelledby="every-session">
    <SectionHeader
      eyebrow="Every Single Session"
      title="What all three classes have in common"
      titleId="every-session"
      lead="No matter which class your child is in, every WCP session includes these five things."
    />
    <ul class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5">
      {
        everyDay.map((e) => (
          <FeatureCard as="li" icon={e.icon} chip={e.chip} title={e.title}>
            {e.body}
          </FeatureCard>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <Section bg="grey" labelledby="twos-sched">
    <SectionHeader
      eyebrow="Twos Class"
      title="Thursday mornings, 9:30–12:00 pm"
      titleId="twos-sched"
    />
    <p class="mx-auto -mt-8 mb-4 max-w-2xl text-center leading-relaxed text-ink" data-reveal>
      The Twos class meets once a week. The pace is gentle and the session is short by design:
      two-year-olds need transition time, sensory play, and a calm environment to feel safe in a new
      place.
    </p>
    <p class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl text-center text-sm font-semibold text-sky-ink" data-reveal>
      Age requirement: must be {twosFacts?.age?.match(/\d+/)?.[0] ?? '2'} by September 30 &middot; Tuition:
      {twosFacts?.monthly ?? '$70'} per month
    </p>
    <p class="text-center" data-reveal>
      <a href="/classes/twos" class="font-bold text-sky-ink underline underline-offset-2">
        Learn more about the Twos Class
      </a>
    </p>
    <ScheduleTimeline entries={twosSchedule} class="mt-10" />
  </Section>

  <Section bg="white" labelledby="threes-sched">
    <SectionHeader
      eyebrow="Threes Class"
      title="Mon–Wed mornings, 9:30–12:00 pm"
      titleId="threes-sched"
    />
    <p class="mx-auto -mt-8 mb-4 max-w-2xl text-center leading-relaxed text-ink" data-reveal>
      Three mornings a week gives three-year-olds real routine and rhythm. The Threes day has more
      structure: two circle times, a group activity, and centers, while still leaving room for free
      play.
    </p>
    <p class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl text-center text-sm font-semibold text-sky-ink" data-reveal>
      Age requirement: must be {threesFacts?.age?.match(/\d+/)?.[0] ?? '3'} by September 30 &middot; Tuition:
      {threesFacts?.monthly ?? '$150'} per month
    </p>
    <p class="text-center" data-reveal>
      <a href="/classes/threes" class="font-bold text-sky-ink underline underline-offset-2">
        Learn more about the Threes Class
      </a>
    </p>
    <ScheduleTimeline entries={threesSchedule} class="mt-10" />
  </Section>

  <Section bg="grey" labelledby="prekam-sched">
    <SectionHeader
      eyebrow="Pre-K AM Class"
      title="Mon–Thurs mornings, 9:15–12:00 pm"
      titleId="prekam-sched"
    />
    <p class="mx-auto -mt-8 mb-4 max-w-2xl text-center leading-relaxed text-ink" data-reveal>
      Four mornings a week gives Pre-K kids the most time with our curriculum. Each morning includes
      calendar, fine motor work, centers, snack, and outdoor play.
    </p>
    <p class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl text-center text-sm font-semibold text-sky-ink" data-reveal>
      Age requirement: must be {amFacts?.age?.match(/\d+/)?.[0] ?? '4'} by September 30 &middot; Tuition:
      {amFacts?.monthly ?? '$200'} per month
    </p>
    <p class="text-center" data-reveal>
      <a href="/classes/pre-k" class="font-bold text-sky-ink underline underline-offset-2">
        Learn more about Pre-K
      </a>
    </p>
    <ScheduleTimeline entries={prekAmSchedule} class="mt-10" />
  </Section>

  <Section bg="white" labelledby="prekpm-sched">
    <SectionHeader
      eyebrow="Pre-K PM Class"
      title="Mon–Wed afternoons, 12:30–3:15 pm"
      titleId="prekpm-sched"
    />
    <p class="mx-auto -mt-8 mb-4 max-w-2xl text-center leading-relaxed text-ink" data-reveal>
      The PM session covers the same curriculum as the AM class across three afternoons a week.
      Great for families who need mornings free or whose child does better later in the day.
    </p>
    <p class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl text-center text-sm font-semibold text-sky-ink" data-reveal>
      Age requirement: must be {pmFacts?.age?.match(/\d+/)?.[0] ?? '4'} by September 30 &middot; Tuition:
      {pmFacts?.monthly ?? '$175'} per month
    </p>
    <p class="text-center" data-reveal>
      <a href="/classes/pre-k" class="font-bold text-sky-ink underline underline-offset-2">
        Learn more about Pre-K
      </a>
    </p>
    <ScheduleTimeline entries={prekPmSchedule} class="mt-10" />
  </Section>

  <Section bg="grey" labelledby="gallery">
    <SectionHeader
      eyebrow="See It in Action"
      title="Photos from our classrooms"
      titleId="gallery"
      lead="A look at what a real WCP session looks like: the activities, the helpers, the outdoor time, and the moments in between."
    />
    <PhotoGallery photos={galleryPhotos} class="mt-12" />
  </Section>

  <CtaBanner
    title="Want to see it in person?"
    lead="Come for a tour and watch a real session in action. Meet the teachers, see the space, and let your child spend time in the classroom."
  >
    <Fragment slot="actions">
      <Button href="/enroll" variant="accent" size="lg">Schedule a Tour</Button>
      <Button href="/enroll" variant="outline-white" size="lg">Enroll Now</Button>
    </Fragment>
    <Fragment slot="note">Call {site.phone} or email {site.email.general}</Fragment>
  </CtaBanner>
</BaseLayout>
